From ca193ce5b5ba7924ad38654d24222cd0795b31d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 09:18:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Make cinematic scroll experience mobile-responsive and
 optimised

- Quality profile: mobile DPR cap 1.25, 45% particle/panel/wireframe density,
  no shadow maps, smaller/cheaper portal render target, slower terminal redraw
- Adaptive fallback to 1x DPR + lighter scene if a phone sustains <33fps
- Portrait camera framing (back off at the door, close in on the laptop);
  zero effect on landscape/desktop
- Idempotent resize via ResizeObserver + orientationchange; canvas sized in
  lvh so the address bar never changes it; no scene recreation
- prefers-reduced-motion: unscrubbed, render-on-change, frozen ambient motion
- Touch-friendly hamburger nav, fixed navbar, hero-bottom overflow fix on phones
- Full listener/loop/resource cleanup on unmount

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GduWwzosU2paBti3qSezKP
